---
import GuideArticle from '../layouts/GuideArticle.astro'; import { citer } from '../lib/cite.js';
const { c, used, U } = citer();
// [tool, best for, free option, paid billed yearly, paid billed monthly, works in, the catch]
const rows = [
 ['Microsoft 365 Copilot in Excel','Teams that already live in Excel and Microsoft 365',`Copilot Chat free with eligible Microsoft 365 plans; Copilot in Excel needs a paid Copilot license${c('ms-excel-1107')}`,`Copilot Business add-on $18–21/user/mo yearly (promo $18 first year to 31 Dec 2026, then $21); or Business Standard with Copilot $23.50, Business Premium with Copilot $32${c('ms-excel-1107')}`,`Add-on $25.20; Standard with Copilot $28.20; Premium with Copilot $38.40${c('ms-excel-1107')}`,`Excel (desktop, web, mobile)${c('ms-excel-1107')}`,`Needs Microsoft 365; advanced agents (Cowork, Autopilot) are usage-billed on top${c('ms-excel-1107')}`],
 ['Gemini in Google Sheets','Teams that already live in Google Workspace / Sheets',`Google Sheets itself is free with a Google Account; Gemini in Sheets needs Business Standard or above${c('gws-sheets-prod-1107','gws-sheets-1107')}`,`Inside Business Standard $14/user/mo yearly; Business Plus $22${c('gws-sheets-1107','gws-plans-1107')}`,`Business Standard $16.80 Flexible; Business Plus $26.40 Flexible${c('gws-plans-1107')}`,`Google Sheets${c('gws-sheets-prod-1107')}`,`Not on Business Starter; Sheets AI has monthly usage limits${c('gws-sheets-1107')}`],
 ['ChatGPT Business','Teams that want one assistant for spreadsheets and everything else',`Free ChatGPT plan exists for individuals${c('oai-biz-1107')}`,`Standard $20/seat/mo; Premium $100/seat/mo${c('oai-bizhelp-1107')}`,`Standard $25/seat/mo; Premium $125/seat/mo${c('oai-bizhelp-1107')}`,`Upload Excel/CSV; Excel, Word, PowerPoint and Google Sheets extensions listed on ChatGPT pricing${c('oai-biz-1107')}`,`Not built into Excel or Sheets; for 2–200 people; minimum usually 2 seats${c('oai-biz-1107','oai-bizhelp-1107')}`],
 ['Claude Team','Long spreadsheet analysis, formulas and careful number work in chat / Claude Docs',`Claude Free includes Claude Docs${c('claude-1107')}`,`Standard $20/seat/mo (2–150 people)${c('claude-1107')}`,`Standard $25/seat/mo${c('claude-1107')}`,`Upload files; Claude Docs${c('claude-1107')}`,`Not built into Excel or Sheets; usage limits apply${c('claude-1107')}`],
 ['Better Analyst (was Formula Bot)','Ops people who want to chat with Excel/Sheets data and connected sources',`Free $0: 10 chat messages/mo, 100 AI credits/mo, 1 connected data source${c('ba-1107')}`,`Pro $20/mo billed $240/yr (1 person); Team $119/mo billed $1,428/yr (5 people included)${c('ba-1107')}`,`Monthly price ${U} (page showed annual toggle when checked)${c('ba-1107')}`,`Upload Excel/CSV/PDF; connect Google Sheets and many data sources${c('ba-1107')}`,`Its own workspace, not inside Excel; bulk jobs use AI credits${c('ba-1107')}`],
 ['Rows','Historical: AI spreadsheet that imported live business data',`Free plan listed $0 with 5 AI Tasks/mo${c('rows-1107')}`,`Plus $6/user/mo; Pro $59/mo + $6/user${c('rows-1107')}`,`Plus $8/user/mo; Pro $79/mo + $8/user${c('rows-1107')}`,`Rows' own grid${c('rows-1107')}`,`Rows joined Superhuman and planned to wind down Rows.com on 31 May 2026; page now points to Superhuman Docs${c('rows-sh-1107','rows-1107')}`],
];
const body = `
<p class="muted small">Prices checked 7 Nov 2026 on each company's own pricing or product page, in US dollars. "Yearly" means the monthly price when you pay for a year up front. Taxes may be added.</p>
<div class="tldr"><p><b>The longer answer.</b> If your team already works in <b>Excel on Microsoft 365</b>, buy <b>Copilot in Excel</b>: the Copilot Business add-on is $18 a user a month for the first year (promo to 31 Dec 2026), then $21, paid yearly, or $25.20 monthly, on top of Microsoft 365${c('ms-excel-1107')}. If you live in <b>Google Sheets</b>, use <b>Gemini in Sheets</b> on Google Workspace Business Standard ($14 a user yearly, $16.80 Flexible) or Plus — it isn't on Business Starter${c('gws-sheets-1107','gws-plans-1107')}. Not locked into either suite? Upload the file to <b>ChatGPT Business</b> or <b>Claude Team</b> ($20 a seat yearly, $25 monthly)${c('oai-bizhelp-1107','claude-1107')}, or try <b>Better Analyst</b> (formerly Formula Bot) free, then Pro at $20 a month billed yearly for one person${c('ba-1107')}. Skip <b>Rows</b> for new buys: it joined Superhuman and planned to wind down Rows.com on 31 May 2026${c('rows-sh-1107')}.</p></div>

<h2>Side by side</h2>
<p>Every number below comes from the company's own page. Where a price isn't shown or didn't load, it says ${U}.</p>
<div class="gtable-wrap"><table class="gtab"><thead><tr><th></th><th>Best for</th><th>Free option</th><th>Paid, billed yearly</th><th>Paid, billed monthly</th><th>Works in</th><th>The catch</th></tr></thead><tbody>
${rows.map(([k,f,a,b,m,w,x])=>`<tr><td data-l="" class="nm">${k}</td><td data-l="Best for">${f}</td><td data-l="Free option">${a}</td><td data-l="Paid, billed yearly">${b}</td><td data-l="Paid, billed monthly">${m}</td><td data-l="Works in">${w}</td><td data-l="The catch">${x}</td></tr>`).join('')}
</tbody></table></div>

<h2>Best if you already use Excel: Microsoft 365 Copilot</h2>
<p>Copilot sits inside Excel (and Word, PowerPoint, Outlook and Teams). Microsoft says it analyzes data, creates charts and generates insights in Excel${c('ms-excel-1107')}. Copilot in Excel is part of the paid Copilot license, not the free Copilot Chat that comes with eligible Microsoft 365 plans${c('ms-excel-1107')}.</p>
<p>For small business, Microsoft lists three yearly options: Microsoft 365 Copilot Business as an add-on at $21 a user a month ($18 for the first year on the promo that runs to 31 December 2026), Microsoft 365 Business Standard with Copilot at $23.50, and Business Premium with Copilot at $32${c('ms-excel-1107')}. Monthly billing is $25.20 for the add-on, $28.20 for Standard with Copilot and $38.40 for Premium with Copilot${c('ms-excel-1107')}. Plans cover up to 300 users${c('ms-excel-1107')}. Everyday Copilot in the apps is included; advanced experiences such as Cowork and Autopilot are billed by usage${c('ms-excel-1107')}. Microsoft says prompts and responses aren't used to train the underlying models${c('ms-excel-1107')}. For the Copilot vs ChatGPT seat decision, read <a href="/microsoft-copilot-vs-chatgpt-for-business/">Microsoft 365 Copilot vs ChatGPT for business</a>.</p>

<h2>Best if you already use Google Sheets: Gemini in Sheets</h2>
<p>Gemini in Sheets helps you build and edit spreadsheets from a prompt, write and fix formulas, surface insights, fill tables and turn data into interactive mini-apps (Sheets canvas)${c('gws-sheets-prod-1107')}. Anyone with a Google Account can use Sheets; some Gemini in Sheets features need a Google Workspace plan${c('gws-sheets-prod-1107')}.</p>
<p>On Google's Workspace pricing comparison, Gemini in Sheets is not on Business Starter; it is listed for Business Standard, Business Plus and Enterprise${c('gws-sheets-1107')}. Business Standard is $14 a user a month on the annual plan or $16.80 on the Flexible plan; Business Plus is $22 annual or $26.40 Flexible; Business Starter is $7 annual or $8.40 Flexible${c('gws-plans-1107','gws-sheets-1107')}. Starter, Standard and Plus top out at 300 users${c('gws-sheets-1107')}. Google says your company data is not used to train models when you chat with Gemini in Workspace${c('gws-sheets-1107')}.</p>

<h2>Best general assistants for spreadsheet files: ChatGPT Business and Claude Team</h2>
<p><b>ChatGPT Business</b> Standard seats are $20 a month billed yearly or $25 monthly; Premium seats are $100 yearly or $125 monthly${c('oai-bizhelp-1107')}. Business is for teams of 2 to 200, usually with a 2-seat minimum${c('oai-biz-1107','oai-bizhelp-1107')}. ChatGPT's pricing page lists Excel, Word, PowerPoint and Google Sheets extensions among plan features, and Interactive tables and charts${c('oai-biz-1107')}. OpenAI's Business comparison states no training on your business data by default${c('oai-biz-1107')}.</p>
<p><b>Claude Team</b> costs the same for a Standard seat: $20 a month billed yearly or $25 monthly, for 2 to 150 people, and includes Claude Docs; Anthropic says there's no model training on your content by default${c('claude-1107')}. Even Claude Free lists Claude Docs${c('claude-1107')}. These assistants are great for asking questions about a file you upload; they are not a full Excel or Sheets replacement. Deeper head-to-head: <a href="/chatgpt-vs-claude-for-business/">ChatGPT vs Claude for business</a>.</p>

<h2>Best dedicated AI data analyst for ops: Better Analyst (formerly Formula Bot)</h2>
<p>Formula Bot rebranded to Better Analyst; formulabot.com redirects to betteranalyst.com${c('ba-1107')}. You upload Excel, CSV, TSV or PDF, or connect Google Sheets and sources such as BigQuery, Snowflake, HubSpot, Power BI and Tableau, then ask questions in plain English${c('ba-1107')}. Free is $0 with 10 chat messages a month, 100 AI credits and one connected data source${c('ba-1107')}. Pro is $20 a month billed $240 a year for one person, with unlimited chat (chat never uses credits) and 3,000 AI credits a month for bulk work such as PDF-to-Excel${c('ba-1107')}. Team is $119 a month billed $1,428 a year with 5 people included and $12 a month per extra person, up to 50; viewers are free${c('ba-1107')}. The monthly (non-annual) sticker price wasn't shown on the annual view we loaded: ${U}${c('ba-1107')}. Analysis runs in an isolated sandbox per chat, with encrypted connection credentials${c('ba-1107')}.</p>

<h2>About Rows</h2>
<p>Rows was an AI spreadsheet with its own grid, live integrations and metered "AI Tasks". Its pricing page still lists Free ($0, 5 AI Tasks a month), Plus ($8 a user monthly or $6 yearly) and Pro ($79 a month + $8 a user, or $59 + $6 yearly)${c('rows-1107')}. The same pages say Rows has joined Superhuman and point visitors to Superhuman Docs; Rows' own blog said the product would wind down on 31 May 2026 after the Superhuman acquisition${c('rows-sh-1107','rows-1107')}. Treat those prices as historical, not a new purchase path.</p>

<h2>What it costs for a small team</h2>
<p><b>Example, 5 people, paying yearly:</b> Gemini in Sheets is already inside Google Workspace Business Standard at $70 a month (5 × $14)${c('gws-plans-1107')}. Copilot Business add-on is $90 a month at the $18 promo, or $105 at $21, on top of whatever you already pay for Microsoft 365${c('ms-excel-1107')}. ChatGPT Business or Claude Team Standard is $100 a month (5 × $20)${c('oai-bizhelp-1107','claude-1107')}. Better Analyst Team for 5 people is $119 a month billed yearly${c('ba-1107')}. For all AI agent prices side by side, see <a href="/how-much-does-an-ai-agent-cost/">how much an AI agent costs</a>.</p>

<h2>Verdict: which should you use?</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Excel shop on Microsoft 365:</b> Copilot in Excel${c('ms-excel-1107')}.</li>
<li><b>Sheets shop on Google Workspace:</b> Gemini in Sheets on Business Standard or above${c('gws-sheets-1107')}.</li>
<li><b>Mixed tools, or you mainly upload files:</b> ChatGPT Business or Claude Team seats you already need${c('oai-bizhelp-1107','claude-1107')}.</li>
<li><b>Ops person who wants chat + dashboards on connected data:</b> Better Analyst, start free then Pro or Team${c('ba-1107')}.</li>
<li><b>Looking at Rows:</b> don't buy new — it joined Superhuman / wound down Rows.com${c('rows-sh-1107')}.</li>
</ul>
<p>Spreadsheets are one job. For writing, decks and the rest of ops, read the <a href="/best-ai-writing-tool/">best AI writing tool</a>, the <a href="/best-ai-presentation-maker/">best AI presentation maker</a>, the <a href="/best-ai-agent-for-small-business/">best AI agent for small business</a>, take the <a href="/quiz/">1-minute quiz</a>, or grab the free <a href="/guide/">buyer's guide</a>.</p>
`;
const faqs = [
 ['What is the best AI for Excel for business?',`If you already use Microsoft 365, Copilot in Excel (Copilot Business add-on $18–21 a user yearly, or a Microsoft 365 + Copilot bundle). If you use Google Sheets, Gemini in Sheets on Business Standard or above. Otherwise ChatGPT Business or Claude Team at $20 a seat yearly${c('ms-excel-1107','gws-sheets-1107','oai-bizhelp-1107','claude-1107')}.`],
 ['How much does Microsoft Copilot in Excel cost?',`Copilot Business add-on is $21 per user per month paid yearly ($18 first-year promo to 31 Dec 2026) or $25.20 monthly. Bundles: Business Standard with Copilot $23.50 yearly ($28.20 monthly), Business Premium with Copilot $32 yearly ($38.40 monthly)${c('ms-excel-1107')}.`],
 ['Does Google Sheets have AI?',`Yes. Gemini in Sheets builds and edits spreadsheets, writes formulas, surfaces insights and creates mini-apps. It isn't on Business Starter; Business Standard is $14 a user yearly or $16.80 Flexible${c('gws-sheets-prod-1107','gws-sheets-1107','gws-plans-1107')}.`],
 ['Can ChatGPT or Claude work with Excel files?',`Yes. Both accept file uploads for analysis. ChatGPT's pricing page also lists Excel and Google Sheets extensions. Business seats are $20 a month yearly or $25 monthly for Standard on both ChatGPT Business and Claude Team${c('oai-biz-1107','oai-bizhelp-1107','claude-1107')}.`],
 ['How much does Better Analyst (Formula Bot) cost?',`Free is $0. Pro is $20 a month billed $240 a year for one person. Team is $119 a month billed $1,428 a year with 5 people included and $12 per extra person${c('ba-1107')}.`],
 ['Is Rows still available?',`Rows joined Superhuman and planned to wind down Rows.com on 31 May 2026. Its pricing page still lists Free, Plus and Pro tiers but points new visitors to Superhuman Docs${c('rows-sh-1107','rows-1107')}.`],
];
---
<GuideArticle slug="best-ai-for-excel" updated="2026-11-07" kicker="Best for"
 title="Best AI for Excel and Spreadsheets for Business (2026): Copilot vs Gemini in Sheets vs ChatGPT | AgentStackWatch"
 desc="The best AI for Excel and spreadsheets for business in 2026: Microsoft 365 Copilot in Excel, Gemini in Google Sheets, ChatGPT Business, Claude Team, Better Analyst and Rows. Free plans, price per seat, the catch. Every fact sourced."
 h1="The best AI for Excel and spreadsheets for business (2026)"
 dek="Copilot in Excel, Gemini in Sheets, ChatGPT, Claude, Better Analyst and Rows. Free plans, price per seat, which grid each one works in, and which to pick."
 faqs={faqs} used={used}
 related={[['/microsoft-copilot-vs-chatgpt-for-business/','Microsoft 365 Copilot vs ChatGPT for business'],['/how-much-does-an-ai-agent-cost/','How much does an AI agent cost?'],['/best-ai-agent-for-small-business/','Best AI agent for small business'],['/chatgpt-vs-claude-for-business/','ChatGPT vs Claude for business'],['/quiz/','Quiz: which AI agent should you use?']]}>
